\"color:#0078D4;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><b>JungHee Park</b></span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"color:#505050;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">Support Escalation Engineer</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"color:#505050;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">Azure | IaaS VM</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"color:#505050;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">+82 (2) 531-4562&nbsp;|&nbsp;</span><a href=\"mailto:jupark@microsoft.com\"><span style=\"color:#467886;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">jupark@microsoft.com</span></a><span style=\"color:#505050;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"color:#505050;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">Working hours: M-F 9:00am – 6:00pm KST</span><br><br><br>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"display:none;\" id=\"newsignature\">&nbsp;</div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"replyfwdmessage\"><p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma, Verdana, Arial;font-size:small;\">------------------- Original Message -------------------</span><br><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma, Verdana, Arial;font-size:small;\"><b>From:</b> supportmail@techsupport.microsoft.com;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma, Verdana, Arial;font-size:small;\"><b>Received:</b> Thu Jul 23 2026 13:41:19 GMT+0900 (Korean Standard Time)</span><br><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma, Verdana, Arial;font-size:small;\"><b>To:</b> seongil.han@kt.com;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma, Verdana, Arial;font-size:small;\"><b>Cc:</b> Keehoon Kim &lt;keki@techsupport.microsoft.com&gt;; Jay Park &lt;parkjay@techsupport.microsoft.com&gt;; Yongha Hwang &lt;yonghahwang@techsupport.microsoft.com&gt;; Kenneth.Kim@microsoft.com; parkjay@microsoft.com; yonghahwang@microsoft.com; az.support@kt.com; jupark@microsoft.com; sung_wook.kim@kt.com; sunghwan.jeong@kt.com; sangil.jo@kt.com; lee.seoungmin@kt.com; jieun.my@kt.com; supportmail@techsupport.microsoft.com;&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma, Verdana, Arial;font-size:small;\"><b>Subject:</b> Re: [S-7527] OS Disk Depth 관련 문의 드립니다 - TrackingID#2607210030002868</span><br><br>&nbsp;</p><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ck-content\" style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-size:11pt;\" data-wrapper=\"true\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"direction:ltr;\"><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">안녕하세요</span>.</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">마이크로소프트 기술 지원팀에 문의해 주셔서 감사합니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">전달주신 자료를 잘 받았습니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">Azure Linux VM<span lang=\"KO\">의 성능 상태를 분석하기 위해 추가로 아래와 같이</span> Performance Diagnostics <span lang=\"KO\">도구인</span> PerfInsights<span lang=\"KO\">를</span> Standalone <span lang=\"KO\">방식으로 실행하여 진단 자료를 수집해 주시기 바랍니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">아래 작업은</span> root <span lang=\"KO\">권한 또는</span> sudo <span lang=\"KO\">권한이 있는 계정으로 진행해 주십시오</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><b>1. <span lang=\"KO\">사전 준비사항</span></b></span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">RHEL BYOS <span lang=\"KO\">환경에서는 패키지 설치를 위해 서버가</span> Red Hat Subscription Manager <span lang=\"KO\">또는</span> Red Hat Satellite<span lang=\"KO\">에 정상적으로 연결되어 있어야 합니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">다음 명령으로 구독 상태를 확인해 주십시오</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">sudo subscription-manager status</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">Python 3, wget <span lang=\"KO\">및</span> tar<span lang=\"KO\">가 설치되어 있지 않은 경우 다음 명령으로 설치합니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">sudo yum install -y python3 wget tar</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">과거의</span> CPU, <span lang=\"KO\">메모리</span>, <span lang=\"KO\">디스크 사용 이력을 함께 수집하려면</span> sysstat <span lang=\"KO\">패키지가 설치되어 있어야 합니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">필요 시 다음과 같이 설치 및 활성화합니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">sudo yum install -y sysstat</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">sudo systemctl enable --now sysstat</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">임시 작업 디렉터리를 생성한 후</span> PerfInsights<span lang=\"KO\">를 다운로드합니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">sudo mkdir -p /tmp/PerfInsights</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">sudo chmod 755 /tmp/PerfInsights</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">cd /tmp/PerfInsights</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">wget </span><a href=\"https://download.microsoft.com/download/9/F/8/9F80419C-D60D-45F1-8A98-718855F25722/PerfInsights.tar.gz\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">https://download.microsoft.com/download/9/F/8/9F80419C-D60D-45F1-8A98-718855F25722/PerfInsights.tar.gz</span></a></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">다운로드한 파일의 압축을 해제합니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">tar xzvf PerfInsights.tar.gz</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">압축 해제 후&nbsp;</span>perfinsights.py <span lang=\"KO\">파일이 위치한 디렉터리로 이동합니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">find /tmp/PerfInsights -name perfinsights.py</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">cd &lt;perfinsights.py <span lang=\"KO\">파일이 위치한 디렉터리</span>&gt;</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><b>2. <span lang=\"KO\">성능 저하 구간 수집</span></b></span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">CPU, <span lang=\"KO\">메모리</span>, <span lang=\"KO\">디스크 또는 네트워크 성능 저하 현상을 분석하기 위해 문제가 발생하거나 재현되는 시간에 다음 명령을 실행합니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">30<span lang=\"KO\">분간 수집하는 예시는 다음과 같습니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">sudo python3 perfinsights.py -r vmslow -d 30M -a -o /tmp/perfinsights-output</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">수집이 완료되면 지정한 출력 디렉터리에 다음 형식의 압축 파일이 생성됩니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">PerformanceDiagnostics_yyyy-MM-dd_hh-mm-ss-fff.tar.gz</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"background-color:white;color:#201F1E;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">생성된 다음 파일을&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">이전에 공유드린 링크로 업로드해 주시기 바랍니다</span>.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fprotect2.fireeye.com%2Fv1%2Furl%3Fk%3Dc28a9304-a1ddfecc-c28bb87a-74fe486eb97a-57eb1abbf89b9381%26q%3D1%26e%3D839cef18-1e1f-4ce1-9e2e-e1ae434b62da%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fsupport.microsoft.com%252Ffiles%253Fworkspace%253DeyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjRDNDlERjM3REYxMzc3MDI3RjQ2NzY1NDVEQzc5ODFCMUE5Mzc1MTgiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..iokssEy5hr9SPriAahzAfVbOcV-7j9BD-z7IPldGvkvKtMgA0VjY